note ---- the queue (written by forged: a less trusted process). Lines:
note   Z <tab> did <tab> ORCID iD <tab> DOI (empty or 10.5281/zenodo.<digits>)
note   P <tab> did <tab> rid <tab> ORCID iD (may be empty)
note Accepted requests go to stdout with the author id they are filed under as the last field:
note the ORCID iD lowercased, or key- and the first 16 hex characters of SHA-256 over the did (a
note repository brought without an ORCID iD that this key added). Refusals go to stderr.
note Slots: 1 add dir, 2 state, 3 allow, 4 remove, 5 reg dir; a line's fields go to 0 (rid or DOI),
note 6 (ORCID iD) and 7 (did).
fn getoff to ulong
